    description: "Senses the presence of living things. With one melee round (15 seconds) of concentration the Lemurian can pinpoint a specific kind of animal or plant inside the range; a hiding animal is felt as near but may not be located. Undead and evil supernatural beings stand out loudly, so their presence and rough proximity are always felt. Range: 25 foot (7.6 m) radius, +5 feet (1.5 m) per level of experience. Base skill to locate, track or find a specific type of animal or plant: 20% +5% per level, +5% more underwater. While in use it adds +5% to the Tracking, Hunting and Identify Plants and Fruit skills. Some Lemurian O.C.C.s print a stronger version."
  - name: "2. Empathy with Animals (Animal Brothers)"
    description: "Like the Psi-Stalker''s and Simvan''s affinity. Domesticated animals take to a Lemurian at once and try to please him: he can ride any horse, wild or tame, or any other non-predatory land or water animal at +10%, and the same +10% applies to skills for working with domestic animals. Wild animals treat him as one of their own: they do not flee, fall silent or raise an alarm at his approach, and take no hostile action unless he threatens, attacks, tries to capture them or enters guarded territory. NOT covered: monsters, felines, sharks, sea serpents, sea dragons, intelligent mutant animals and mutant or alien predators, which see a Lemurian as a rival hunter, tend to attack him first and cannot be won over. Xiticix, other insectoids and every kind of undead sense Lemurians as natural enemies. The Lemurian also feels the fear and pain of animals in distress whether he wants to or not."
  - name: "3. Pets and Familiars"
