printed 55. Literacy: Lemurian 85% +1% is stored on the catalog row Literacy: Lemurian at 85 and 1 per level. Mathematics: Basic 82 +1. Swimming 78 +2. These are printed as flat figures, not as bonuses over a base. Language: Cetacean is stored at 86 and 1 per level although the race entry (printed 47-50) does not list it: the skill description on printed 55 calls it a native language for Lemurians and Merans and gives that figure for native speakers. || PSIONICS: all Lemurians have at least Minor psionics, with a percentile table (01-60 Minor, 61-90 Major, 91-00 Master). Stored as a banded choose-1 group whose options carry the psionics blocks, with psionics_allowed false so the standard random roll is not offered as well. A fourth, unbanded option carries no block, for the page''s Note that an O.C.C. printing its own set of psionic abilities replaces these rather than adding to them. Minor: three named powers, two picks from Physical or Sensitive, I.S.P. M.E. +1D6 per level. Major: three named powers and four picks from Healing, Physical and Sensitive, I.S.P. M.E. +8, +2D4 per level; the row''s second reading (the named three plus two from one category, or one Super power) and the trade of three abilities for one of seven listed Super powers are prose. Master: type only, powers and I.S.P. as per the Psychic O.C.C. taken; the eight-row O.C.C. table is prose and no occ_options is stored, because the page allows ANY Psychic O.C.C. from three books and a list would offer fewer. The table names a Shrieker as being in this book; no class of that name is printed in it. || NOT STORED: height 5 feet +3D8 inches, weight 100 to 220 lbs, life span 300 years (some 400), childbearing and childhood ages, disposition; the Special R.C.C. Abilities 1 to 6 and the Natural Abilities are display text."
